<head>

<title>Desinstalação da licença individual</title>

<meta name="generator" content="Art Systems" />

<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=windows-1252" />

<meta http-equiv="Content-Style-Type" content="text/css" />

<link type="text/css" href="ft.css" rel="stylesheet" />

</head>

<body style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px; background: #FFFFFF;" link="#0000A0" vlink="#0000A0" alink="#0000A0">

<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5" bgcolor="#D0D0D0">

<tr valign="middle">

<td align="left">

<p style="margin: 8px 0px 8px 0px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; color: #000000;">Primeiros passos</span></p>

<p style="margin: 7px 0px 7px 0px;"><span style="font-weight: bold; color: #0099FF;">Desinstalação da licença individual</span></p>

</td><td align="right" valign="top">

<span><a href="fl_sim_p_9.htm"><img src="top.png" width="30" height="23" border="0"></a>&nbsp;

<a href="fl_sim_p_17.htm"><img src="prev.png" width="30" height="23" border="0"></a>&nbsp;

<a href="fl_sim_p_19.htm"><img src="next.png" width="30" height="23" border="0"></a>&nbsp;

</span></td></tr></table><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="10" cellpadding="0">
<tr>
<td>
Para remover o FluidSIM do computador, siga estas etapas:

<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">

<tr valign="top">

<td width="35">

<img src="instruct.png" width="30" height="20">

</td><td>Execute o atalho <span style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: 'Courier New';">Remover FluidSIM Pneumática</span> no menu Iniciar, em <span style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: 'Courier New';">Programas/Festo Didactic/Desinstalação</span>. Se você excluiu o atalho ou não consegue encontrá-lo, execute o programa <span style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: 'Courier New';">unwise.exe</span> na <span style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: 'Courier New';">bin</span>-<a href="fl_sim_p_17.htm">subpasta</a> da pasta do FluidSIM.

</td></tr></table>

</td>

</tr>

</table>

</body>

</html>


